# cypress.env.json is committed in this exercise ONLY because Fake Store API
# is a public sandbox and these are its documented demo credentials (not real
# secrets). In a real project this line would stay UNCOMMENTED so the file
# never reaches source control; real credentials would instead be injected
# via CI/CD secret variables (CYPRESS_apiUsername / CYPRESS_apiPassword) or a
# local, untracked cypress.env.json copied from cypress.env.json.example.
